cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use buzzdetect, please cite the paper for the method and the Zenodo record for the version you used."
title: "buzzdetect"
type: software
abstract: >-
  buzzdetect is a tool for passive acoustic monitoring of pollinator activity.
  It uses machine learning to analyze audio and identify the buzz of insect
  flight, enabling highly scalable, temporally rich observation.
authors:
